Twinkie-2B Responsible AI License

Dated: November 2026

1. PREAMBLE
Twinkie-2B is developed as a dedicated learning assistant for children aged 6 to 12. 
To safeguard children, enforce responsible AI practices, and prevent weaponization or abuse, 
this Model is released under the Open Responsible AI License - Model (OpenRAIL-M).

2. DEFINITIONS
- "License": Means this OpenRAIL-M agreement and its Use Restrictions (Attachment A).
- "Licensor": The copyright holder(s) of Twinkie-2B.
- "Model": The machine-learning based assemblies (including weights, LoRA adapters, parameters, 
  and configurations) fine-tuned, merged, or quantized as Twinkie-2B.
- "Derivatives of the Model": Any modifications, fine-tunes, quantizations (such as GGUF, AWQ, EXL2), 
  pruned variants, merged checkpoints, or distillation outputs based on the Model.
- "Output": The text or representations generated by the operation of the Model.
- "You" (or "Your"): An individual or legal entity exercising permissions granted by this License.

