================================================================================
ATTACHMENT A: USE RESTRICTIONS
================================================================================

You agree NOT to use the Model, Derivatives of the Model, or Outputs:

1. Child Safety & Minor Protection:
   - In any manner that exploits, harms, endangers, or attempts to exploit or harm minors in any way.
   - To generate, disseminate, solicit, or facilitate Child Sexual Abuse Material (CSAM), child sexual 
     exploitation and abuse (CSAE), or any content depicting, encouraging, or sexualizing minors.
   - To deploy unmonitored, unguarded, or deceptive chat systems targeted at children without verified 
     parental consent and fail-closed safety guardrails.
   - To solicit, collect, or store Personally Identifiable Information (PII) from children under 18 
     (including full names, home addresses, phone numbers, school names, or photographs).

2. Self-Harm & Violence:
   - To generate content that encourages, normalizes, or provides instructions for self-harm, suicide, 
     eating disorders, or physical violence.
   - To generate instructions or logistical assistance for manufacturing, acquiring, or using firearms, 
     weapons, explosives, poisons, or hazardous chemical and biological agents.

3. Harassment & Abuse:
   - For bullying, stalking, harassing, threatening, defaming, or extorting any individual or minor.
   - To generate hateful content that promotes discrimination, exclusion, or disparagement based on race, 
     ethnicity, religion, gender, sexual orientation, disability, or age.

4. Deception & Medical Misinformation:
   - To generate verifiably false medical, diagnostic, pharmacological, or mental health advice targeted at children.
   - To impersonate real individuals (including parents, guardians, teachers, or pediatricians) without authorization.

